{"id":1748739,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-14T12:04:18.978Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1748739,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Sesegar Nailofar","overview":"# English Translation  The friendship between Iqbal and Salsabila began during their school days. Salsabila admired Iqbal's wisdom in his studies and at the same time he was responsible for his mother and his twin sister, Marisa. Salsabila's mother, Shahera, frequently emphasized to her that she should find a husband within the Sargoff lineage. Secretly, she planned with her sister Zaiton to match Salsabila with Nazim, Zaiton's son who had just completed his studies in England. Salsabila secretly refused because she and Iqbal had begun to love each other. At that time, their residential area became turbulent when members of a criminal group, the Red Crow Group, were arrested. It was destined that Iqbal and Marisa would continue their studies in Egypt. Salsabila was forced to follow her family's instructions and continue her education within the country. Salsabila and Iqbal promised to remain faithful in their relationship and Salsabila also helped finance Iqbal's expenses in Egypt.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/gfcNXOaznIVc4TN6jyfq7FAsNQd.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Sesegar Nailofar","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1959467,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Erwin Dawson","original_name":"Erwin Dawson","popularity":0.4586,"profile_path":"/vvfYlfaIogHafjXrs1H2YgJG1uM.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7dd202cc52650398645ddc","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2146084,"known_for_department":"Act